# Generated by avi12-lint cpp-config from cpp-config-avi12 and avi12-cpp.local.json; do not edit
# Checks that are off, and why:
#   misc-include-cleaner: Win32 headers have hard ordering dependencies, so the include set is authored by hand
#   misc-non-private-member-variables-in-classes: Google style allows public data in a plain struct
#   misc-no-recursion: recursion over a tree is the clearest form; the cognitive complexity limit still bounds a function
#   bugprone-reserved-identifier: the Windows SDK and the CRT define reserved names the code must use
#   cert-dcl37-c: the Windows SDK and the CRT define reserved names the code must use
#   cert-dcl51-cpp: the Windows SDK and the CRT define reserved names the code must use
#   cert-err33-c: checking every printf-family result adds noise; the specific unused-return checks stay
#   performance-enum-size: an enum that mirrors an ABI keeps the width the ABI has
#   modernize-use-trailing-return-type: Google style writes the return type first
#   modernize-use-designated-initializers: the Win32 structs initialise by position
#   misc-use-anonymous-namespace: Google style allows a static function as much as an unnamed namespace, and misc-use-internal-linkage already narrows visibility
#   modernize-avoid-c-arrays: Win32 and COM calls take a buffer as pointer and length, and a fixed buffer on the stack is the idiom there
#   modernize-use-auto: Google style prefers the written type unless the type is obvious from the initializer
#   modernize-raw-string-literal: an escaped literal is as readable and diffs smaller
#   modernize-macro-to-enum: the macros are Win32 and build values the code does not own
#   google-runtime-int: the Win32 ABI types (DWORD, LONG, ULONG) are the contract
#   modernize-return-braced-init-list: a named constructor call reads clearer at a return
#   modernize-use-ranges: its fixer writes std::ranges::sort(range, , comparator) with an empty argument, which does not compile (LLVM 22.1.7)
#   misc-use-internal-linkage: its fixer adds static to DllMain and wmain, which the loader and the linker find by name
#   cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables: the injected DLL keeps its hook originals and state in g_ and o_ globals, named by CLAUDE.md
#   cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast: the DLL binds msedge.dll by RVA and reads fields at reversed offsets, so every Edge pointer is a reinterpret_cast
#   performance-no-int-to-ptr: the DLL binds msedge.dll by RVA, so every Edge function is an integer-to-pointer cast
#   bugprone-multi-level-implicit-pointer-conversion: the Edge bindings go through raw offsets and pointer-to-pointer fields
#   cert-dcl50-cpp: Log() is a printf-style variadic on purpose
#   modernize-avoid-variadic-functions: Log() is a printf-style variadic on purpose
#   bugprone-unchecked-string-to-number-conversion: the callers check the parsed value's range themselves
# Options this repo changes, and why:
#   readability-identifier-naming.ConstexprVariableIgnoredRegexp: offsets.h names each RVA and field offset after the reversed symbol (PascalCase or Class_Method) so it greps against the PDB and docs/re
#   readability-identifier-naming.FunctionIgnoredRegexp: hook detours are h_ on purpose, and wmain is the entry point's own name
#   readability-identifier-naming.GlobalVariableIgnoredRegexp: hook detours are h_ and their originals o_ on purpose
#   readability-identifier-naming.TypeAliasIgnoredRegexp: function-pointer aliases are named after the Edge function they bind, with a _t suffix
#   readability-identifier-naming.TypedefIgnoredRegexp: function-pointer aliases are named after the Edge function they bind, with a _t suffix
#   readability-identifier-naming.StaticVariablePrefix: a function-local static is named like a local; g_ marks the globals and CLAUDE.md has no file-static prefix
#   readability-function-size.NestingThreshold: the hook table, the injected page scripts (raw string literals) and the resolve and split-command sequences are long by design; the Win32 callbacks take the parameters the API defines
#   readability-function-size.ParameterThreshold: the hook table, the injected page scripts (raw string literals) and the resolve and split-command sequences are long by design; the Win32 callbacks take the parameters the API defines
#   readability-function-size.LineThreshold: the hook table, the injected page scripts (raw string literals) and the resolve and split-command sequences are long by design; the Win32 callbacks take the parameters the API defines
#   readability-function-size.StatementThreshold: the hook table, the injected page scripts (raw string literals) and the resolve and split-command sequences are long by design; the Win32 callbacks take the parameters the API defines
#   readability-function-cognitive-complexity.Threshold: Decide and Run are the two decision tables of the resolver and measure 33 and 34
#   bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters.MinimumLength: rect and point helpers take their coordinates as adjacent ints
#   readability-magic-numbers.IgnoredIntegerValues: Edge struct sizes and padding mirror the reversed layouts, and the nibble, channel and decimal-digit masks name themselves
#   readability-magic-numbers.IgnoredFloatingPointValues: halving and doubling a layout weight
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  concurrency-*,
  google-*,
  hicpp-exception-baseclass,
  misc-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables,
  cppcoreguidelines-init-variables,
  cppcoreguidelines-no-malloc,
  cppcoreguidelines-owning-memory,
  cppcoreguidelines-prefer-member-initializer,
  cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-const-cast,
  cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-cstyle-cast,
  cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-member-init,
  cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast,
  cppcoreguidelines-slicing,
  cppcoreguidelines-special-member-functions,
  cppcoreguidelines-virtual-class-destructor,
  readability-avoid-nested-conditional-operator,
  readability-braces-around-statements,
  readability-const-return-type,
  readability-container-size-empty,
  readability-delete-null-pointer,
  readability-duplicate-include,
  readability-else-after-return,
  readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  readability-function-size,
  readability-identifier-length,
  readability-identifier-naming,
  readability-implicit-bool-conversion,
  readability-inconsistent-declaration-parameter-name,
  readability-isolate-declaration,
  readability-magic-numbers,
  readability-make-member-function-const,
  readability-misleading-indentation,
  readability-misplaced-array-index,
  readability-non-const-parameter,
  readability-qualified-auto,
  readability-redundant-control-flow,
  readability-redundant-declaration,
  readability-redundant-member-init,
  readability-redundant-preprocessor,
  readability-redundant-smartptr-get,
  readability-redundant-string-cstr,
  readability-simplify-boolean-expr,
  readability-string-compare,
  -misc-include-cleaner,
  -misc-non-private-member-variables-in-classes,
  -misc-no-recursion,
  -bugprone-reserved-identifier,
  -cert-dcl37-c,
  -cert-dcl51-cpp,
  -cert-err33-c,
  -performance-enum-size,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -modernize-use-designated-initializers,
  -misc-use-anonymous-namespace,
  -modernize-avoid-c-arrays,
  -modernize-use-auto,
  -modernize-raw-string-literal,
  -modernize-macro-to-enum,
  -google-runtime-int,
  -modernize-return-braced-init-list,
  -modernize-use-ranges,
  -misc-use-internal-linkage,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast,
  -performance-no-int-to-ptr,
  -bugprone-multi-level-implicit-pointer-conversion,
  -cert-dcl50-cpp,
  -modernize-avoid-variadic-functions,
  -bugprone-unchecked-string-to-number-conversion
HeaderFilterRegex: 'dll[/\\](src|test)[/\\].*\.h$'
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
FormatStyle: file
CheckOptions:
  readability-function-cognitive-complexity.Threshold: '35'
  readability-function-size.LineThreshold: '270'
  readability-function-size.StatementThreshold: '270'
  readability-function-size.ParameterThreshold: '8'
  readability-function-size.NestingThreshold: '6'
  readability-magic-numbers.IgnoredIntegerValues: '1;2;3;4;7;8;10;15;16;24;32;64;100;1000;65535;4278190080'
  readability-magic-numbers.IgnorePowersOf2IntegerValues: true
  readability-magic-numbers.IgnoreBitFieldsWidths: true
  readability-implicit-bool-conversion.AllowPointerConditions: true
  readability-implicit-bool-conversion.AllowIntegerConditions: true
  readability-else-after-return.WarnOnConditionVariables: false
  bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters.MinimumLength: '4'
  bugprone-unsafe-functions.CustomFunctions: '^::sprintf$,snprintf,it cannot see the size of what it writes into; ^::strcpy$,strcpy_s,it cannot see the size of what it writes into; ^::strcat$,strcat_s,it cannot see the size of what it writes into; ^::wcscpy$,wcscpy_s,it cannot see the size of what it writes into; ^::wcscat$,wcscat_s,it cannot see the size of what it writes into; ^::gets$,fgets,it cannot see the size of what it writes into'
  readability-identifier-length.MinimumVariableNameLength: '3'
  readability-identifier-length.MinimumParameterNameLength: '3'
  readability-identifier-length.IgnoredVariableNames: '^(hr|hwnd|pid|tid|rc|ok|to|i|j|x|y|id)$'
  readability-identifier-length.IgnoredParameterNames: '^(hr|hwnd|pid|tid|rc|ok|to|i|j|x|y|id)$'
  misc-const-correctness.AnalyzeValues: true
  misc-const-correctness.AnalyzeReferences: false
  misc-const-correctness.WarnPointersAsValues: false
  misc-const-correctness.TransformValues: false
  misc-const-correctness.TransformReferences: false
  misc-const-correctness.TransformPointersAsValues: false
  readability-identifier-naming.NamespaceCase: lower_case
  readability-identifier-naming.ClassCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.StructCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.UnionCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.EnumCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.TypeAliasCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.TypedefCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.TemplateParameterCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.FunctionCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.MethodCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.VariableCase: camelBack
  readability-identifier-naming.ParameterCase: camelBack
  readability-identifier-naming.MemberCase: camelBack
  readability-identifier-naming.GlobalVariableCase: camelBack
  readability-identifier-naming.GlobalVariablePrefix: g_
  readability-identifier-naming.ConstexprVariableCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.ConstexprVariablePrefix: k
  readability-identifier-naming.GlobalConstantCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.GlobalConstantPrefix: k
  readability-identifier-naming.StaticConstantCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.StaticConstantPrefix: k
  readability-identifier-naming.ClassConstantCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.ClassConstantPrefix: k
  readability-identifier-naming.EnumConstantCase: CamelCase
  readability-identifier-naming.EnumConstantPrefix: k
  readability-identifier-naming.MacroDefinitionCase: UPPER_CASE
  readability-identifier-naming.StaticVariableCase: camelBack
  readability-identifier-naming.StaticVariablePrefix: ''
  readability-identifier-naming.MacroDefinitionIgnoredRegexp: '^[A-Z0-9_]+_H_$'
  readability-identifier-naming.PrivateMemberCase: camelBack
  readability-identifier-naming.PrivateMemberSuffix: _
  readability-identifier-naming.ProtectedMemberCase: camelBack
  readability-identifier-naming.ProtectedMemberSuffix: _
  readability-identifier-naming.FunctionIgnoredRegexp: '^(h_.*|wmain|DllMain)$'
  readability-identifier-naming.GlobalVariableIgnoredRegexp: '^(o_.*|__.*)$'
  readability-identifier-naming.ConstexprVariableIgnoredRegexp: '^[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*$'
  readability-identifier-naming.TypeAliasIgnoredRegexp: '.*_t$'
  readability-identifier-naming.TypedefIgnoredRegexp: '.*_t$'
  readability-magic-numbers.IgnoredFloatingPointValues: '1.0;100.0;2.0;0.5'
